{"title":"Career Roadmap · FinTech Analyst","role":"FinTech Analyst","summary":"A FinTech Analyst combines finance, technology and data analysis to evaluate digital financial products, payment systems, lending platforms, digital banking, investment technology, fraud detection and financial automation.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – FinTech / Digital Finance"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2028"},{"text":"Finance, accounting, banking and technology foundations"}],[{"text":"2028–2030"},{"text":"Data analytics, digital payments and FinTech internship"}],[{"text":"2030–2033"},{"text":"FinTech Analyst / Business Analyst / Operations Analyst"}],[{"text":"2033–2036"},{"text":"Product analytics, risk analytics or financial data specialisation"}],[{"text":"2036–2040"},{"text":"Senior FinTech Analyst / Product Analyst / Risk Manager"}],[{"text":"2040–2043"},{"text":"FinTech Product Manager / Strategy Manager / Analytics Lead"}],[{"text":"2043–2046"},{"text":"FinTech Head / Digital Finance Leader / FinTech Consultant"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Build This","Key Skills","Proof"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Finance + technology foundation"},{"text":"Accounting, economics, banking, Excel"},{"text":"Finance analysis workbook"}],[{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"Digital finance"},{"text":"Payments, digital banking, SQL, Python"},{"text":"FinTech mini-project"}],[{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Analytics + risk"},{"text":"Power BI, statistics, APIs, fraud analytics"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"FinTech specialisation"},{"text":"Product analytics, credit/risk, AI, automation"},{"text":"Capstone + portfolio"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Finance & Technology Foundation"},{"type":"h","text":"Commerc