raud Rules","Power BI Dashboard"]},{"type":"p","text":"Analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Transaction volume"},{"text":"Transaction value"},{"text":"Success rate"},{"text":"Failure rate"},{"text":"Customer segments"},{"text":"Merchant performance"},{"text":"Transaction velocity"},{"text":"Suspicious transactions"},{"text":"Geographic patterns"},{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Chargebacks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Add an AI/ML component"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a simple anomaly/fraud detection model using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"scikit-learn"},{"text":"SQL"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Possible outputs:"},{"type":"h","text":"Normal Transaction / High-Risk Transaction"},{"type":"p","text":"The project should also explain false positives, model limitations and human review, rather than presenting the model as a perfect fraud detector."}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Learning","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial markets"},{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Financial modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Data"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FinTech"},{"type":"p","text":"Study:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Digital payments"},{"text":"Digital banking"},{"text":"Digital lending"},{"text":"Open banking"},{"text":"Blockchain fundamentals"},{"text":"RegTech"},{"text":"Financial APIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Risk"},{"type":"p","text":"Useful areas:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Credit risk"},{"text":"Fraud analytics"},{"text":"AML/KYC fundamentals"},{"text":"Operational risk"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Professional qualifications such as CFA, FRM, ACCA, CA or CMA may be useful depending on the chosen FinTech path; they are not all necessary for an analyst role."}]},{"heading":"Careers You Can Be Hired As","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Possible entry-level roles:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"FinTech Analyst"},{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Data Analyst"},{"text":"Payments Analyst"},{"text":"Digital Banking Analyst"},{"text":"Credit Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Fraud Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Operations Analyst"},{"text":"MIS Analyst"},{"text":"Business Intelligence Analyst"},{"text":"FinTech Research Analyst"},{"text":"RegTech Analyst"},{"text":"Junior Product Operations Analyst"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Employer interview questions"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is the difference between a bank and a FinTech company?"},{"text":"How does a digital payment transaction work?"},{"text":"What is credit risk?"},{"text":"What is interest income?"},{"text":"What is a non-performing loan?"},{"text":"What is reconciliation?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Technology"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is an API?"},{"text":"Why is SQL important in FinTech?"},{"text":"How would you analyse one million transactions?"},{"text":"How would you design a transaction database?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Analytics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"How would you measure payment success?"},{"text":"How would you identify fraudulent transactions?"},{"text":"What metrics would you use to evaluate a lending product?"},{"text":"How would you analyse customer churn?"},{"text":"How would you investigate an unusual transaction spike?"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Product"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"What is a conversion funnel?"},{"text":"What is A/B testing?"},{"text":"How would you improve a digital-payment checkout?"},{"text":"Which metrics would you monitor after launching a financial product?"},{"text":"How would you balance customer growth with financial risk?"}]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate Study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"MB